## This file in the wild

Conduct's own `REVIEW.md` is the internal version of this template. Every change to the Conduct codebase — including the changes made by AI agents — goes through this gate.

The auth coverage check (`python scripts/check_auth_coverage.py`) that enforces the auth section was itself written by a Claude Code agent, reviewed against this checklist, and is now a blocking CI step.

